Hi,

Here is a short reminder that I will shut down this mailing list in
roughly 2 weeks. Everyone who has not subscribed to the new mailing list
at coconut-svsm@lists.linux.dev please do so ASAP.

New new mailing list has an email-based subscription mechanism, to
subscribe send an email to coconut-svsm+subscribe@lists.linux.dev from
the email account you want to subscribe and follow the instructions in
the email you get back.

Once this mailing list is removed I will install a forward from the
lists old address to the new address.

Regards,

	Joerg
